{"id":"wb-7-1844","name":"丁氏光禄公祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"丁氏光禄公祠","text":"丁氏光禄公祠位于中国广东省揭阳市榕城区西马街道元鼎路，是清末大臣丁日昌的府邸，俗称丁府，1993年被列为揭阳市文物保护单位，2008年被列为广东省文物保护单位，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n整个祠堂建筑占地面积为6100平方米，共有大小房屋99间，地下室1间，平面呈繁体“興”字，在潮汕地区建筑史上极具代表意义和研究价值。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%81%E6%B0%8F%E5%85%89%E7%A6%84%E5%85%AC%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":88972660,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88972660","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6983f706f1bd21c8752910c2.jpg","title":"Jieyang_Dingshi_Guanglugong_Ci_2013.10.27_14-11-13.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jieyang_Dingshi_Guanglugong_Ci_2013.10.27_14-11-13.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/28/Jieyang_Dingshi_Guanglugong_Ci_2013.10.27_14-11-13.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"丁氏光禄公祠","width":320,"height":213}}